OL,3,GNEWSALego models shipped to island for
OL,4,Ahistory display
OL,5,
OL,6,FLego brick models have been shipped
OL,7,Ffrom the UK for an exhibition in
OL,8,FGuernsey telling the stories of
OL,9,Fdifferent moments in history.
OL,11,FThe Walk Through History in Lego bricks
OL,12,Fexhibition opened in the Brian White
OL,13,FGallery at Guernsey Museum at Candie on
OL,14,FFriday and continues until 31 December.
OL,16,FModels have been transported by sea
OL,17,Ffrom the UK to create different
OL,18,Fsections of the gallery representing
OL,19,Fexploration, discovery, science and
OL,20,Fequality.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
