OL,3,GNEWSALego models shipped to island for
OL,4,Ahistory display
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatt Harvey, senior curator at the
OL,7,Fmuseum, said: "Lego is one of the most
OL,8,Ficonic toys... and it was a perfect
OL,9,Fcombination of an entertaining
OL,10,Fcolourful medium and teaching history
OL,11,Fat the same time."
